<section class="section page-section" aria-labelledby="purpose-title">
  <div class="container split-layout">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Our purpose</p><h2 id="purpose-title">Better experiences enable better scientific discovery.</h2></div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>This community hub was established based on the professional training and long-term experiences of user experience (UX) professionals in scientific environments.
      </p>
      <p>UX in Science was founded by <a href="https://drewpaine.net" target="_blank">Drew Paine, PhD</a> to democractize UX knowledge curated for the unique complexities of scientific software ecosystems. The community hub was initially funded by Paine's 2026 Better Scientific Software (BSSw) <a href="#funding-ack">Fellowship</a>.
      </p>
      
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tinted-section" aria-labelledby="objectives-title">
